+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
+/*
+ * A scheduler that validates the behavior of direct dispatching with a default
+ * select_cpu implementation.
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2023 Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
